+---
+description: "TypeScript migration guidance for incrementally modernizing a legacy JavaScript library with strict typing and compatibility safeguards."
+applyTo: "**/*.ts, **/*.tsx, **/*.js, **/*.jsx, **/*.mjs, **/*.cjs"
